/docs/req/                 @Mei-github @creator-xiyuan

# Architecture line (D2 artifacts, D9 Prompt.md).
/docs/architecture/        @xiaolizi33 @swordnew123

# Safety-critical: the authoritative policy kernel. An AI verdict only takes effect if this
# code allows it, so changes here require the architecture owner's co-sign (D7).
/src/contentguard/policy/  @xiaolizi33 @swordnew123

# Governance & CI line (CI configuration and the gate scripts).
/.github/workflows/        @creator-xiyuan @swordnew123
/scripts/                  @creator-xiyuan @swordnew123

